[Desktop Entry]
Name=Logos
Comment=Open Bibles, books, lexicons, guides, searches and reading plans in Logos
Type=Service
Icon=logos-plasma
X-KDE-ServiceTypes=Plasma/Runner
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Name=logos-plasma
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Version=1.0
X-KDE-PluginInfo-License=GPL-3.0-or-later
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Website=https://github.com/FaithLife-Community/logos-plasma-integrations
X-KDE-PluginInfo-EnabledByDefault=true
X-Plasma-API=DBus2
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Service=io.github.FaithlifeCommunity.LogosPlasma
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Path=/runner
X-Plasma-Request-Actions-Once=true
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntaxes=logos,:q:,o :q:,o<bible> :q:,s :q:,stb :q:,':q:,.:q:,lex :q:,ws :q:,fb :q:,ol :q:,or,otc :q:,opg :q:,rp,today,lay
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntax-Descriptions=List every Logos command (add a word to filter),A Bible reference (John 3:16) opens in your preferred Bible,Open a passage: pick from your top Bibles,Open a passage in a specific Bible (oesv; olsb…),Search: Top Bibles or pick a Bible,Search Logos's Top Bibles,Exact-phrase search,Words in any order,Look up a Greek/Hebrew word in your lexicons,Bible Word Study,Factbook (people; places; topics…),Open a book from your library,Recently opened books,Text Comparison of your top Bibles,Passage Guide,Today's reading-plan readings,Today's devotional,Open one of your saved layouts
